      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It actually really upsets me that this isn't at least tracked as it's still an issue now, I've been pushing for many of the event worlds I work on to be iOS compatible, including VRelium's main festival venue, it's becoming tedious asking performers to keep their mic on so iOS users can at least hear them, and an issue for other users close to the stage hearing double.\n\nI have welcomed many new users on iOS to VRChat recently and am regularly asked why the video isn't working no matter what they try.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
