  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have built the world for iOS and tried the MPEG-TS protocol and the fMP4 protocol, but could not play live streaming via VRCDN.\n\nAccording to Apple's iOS specs, TS and fMP4 appear to be supported, and AV Pro's iOS support version was 12 or later, so I thought the platform requirements were met.\n\nI contacted the VRCDN team and their view was that the VRCDN platform is implemented in accordance with the RFC, so whether or not it can play it depends on the iOS implementation of VRChat.\n\nWhat would be a possible way to achieve live streaming playback of VRCDN on the iOS version of VRChat?\n\nEnvironment in which it is being tested: iPhone 15 Pro Max, iOS 17.5.1, VRChat iOS 2024.2.3 (333)",
